#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/maintenance.js:197
msgid "Record technician visits, calls with your ISP, reboots and router changes. Each entry shows up as a numbered marker on the Signal Report charts with a 24-hour before/after comparison, and you can filter the report to show only data after any entry. Modem reboots, loss-of-signal events, level shifts and router reboots are suggested automatically."
msgstr "记录技术人员上门、致电运营商、重启和路由器更换。每条记录都会作为编号标记显示在信号报告图表中，并提供前后 24 小时对比；还可以筛选报告，只显示任一记录之后的数据。调制解调器重启、信号丢失事件、电平变化和路由器重启会自动建议。"

