#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/report.js:131
msgid "A one-page, printable summary for a date range: findings in plain language, day-by-day counts, repairs and calls from the maintenance log, outages and the timeouts the modem logged. Print it or save it as a PDF for your ISP or a regulator."
msgstr "按日期范围生成一页可打印摘要：用通俗语言列出调查结果、逐日统计、维护日志中的维修和通话、断网以及调制解调器记录的超时。可将其打印或保存为 PDF，提交给运营商或监管机构。"

