msgid "Drafts a letter asking your ISP for a credit for the outages recorded in a month, leaving out planned work. Your name, account number, address and monthly price come from Settings → Outage credits. You can edit the letter before printing or copying it."
msgstr "根据某个月记录的断网情况起草一封向运营商申请费用补偿的信件，并排除计划内工作。你的姓名、账号、地址和月费来自“设置 → 断网补偿”。打印或复制前可以编辑信件。"

