#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:295
msgid "Send a daily summary"
msgstr "发送每日摘要"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:296
msgid "Each morning, one notification summarizing yesterday (timeouts, errors, levels, outages, dropouts), sent to the services on the other tabs. Quiet days are worth having on record too."
msgstr "每天早晨发送一条总结前一天情况的通知（超时、错误、电平、断网、短暂中断），发送到其他标签页配置的服务。平静无事的日子同样值得留档。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:299
msgid "Send at"
msgstr "发送时间"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:305
msgid "Try it"
msgstr "试一下"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:306
msgid "Send yesterday's summary now"
msgstr "立即发送昨日摘要"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:315
msgid "Line quality"
msgstr "线路质量"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:317
msgid "1-second latency probe"
msgstr "1 秒延迟探测"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:318
msgid "Sends one small ping per second (about 1 KB/s) to catch jitter and short dropouts of a few seconds that the regular samples miss. Shown on the report, in alerts, the daily summary and the complaint summary."
msgstr "每秒发送一个小 ping（约 1 KB/s），用于捕捉常规采样会遗漏的抖动和数秒级短暂中断。结果会显示在报告、警报、每日摘要和投诉摘要中。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:321
msgid "Probe target"
msgstr "探测目标"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:322
msgid "\"gateway\" = the ISP's first hop past the modem (recommended: it measures your cable segment). Or an address such as 1.1.1.1. Some ISP gateways answer pings at low priority, which can add occasional latency spikes of their own."
msgstr "“gateway”表示调制解调器之后运营商的第一跳（推荐：它测量你的有线电缆区段）。也可以填写 1.1.1.1 等地址。有些运营商网关以低优先级响应 ping，可能偶尔引入自身的延迟尖峰。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:326
msgid "Seconds without reply that count as a dropout"
msgstr "判定为中断的无回复秒数"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:331
msgid "Watch for missing channels"
msgstr "监视丢失的信道"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:332
msgid "Flags samples where the modem holds fewer bonded channels than it did in the last 24 hours (partial service), on the report and in alerts."
msgstr "当调制解调器持有的绑定信道少于过去 24 小时（部分服务异常）时，在报告和警报中标记这些采样。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:336
msgid "Network & weather"
msgstr "网络与天气"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:338
msgid "Ping the ISP gateway"
msgstr "ping 运营商网关"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:339
msgid "Also pings the first hop past the modem (the WAN default gateway). If it loses packets too, the problem is on the local cable segment rather than further out on the internet."
msgstr "同时 ping 调制解调器之后的第一跳（WAN 默认网关）。如果它也丢包，问题更可能位于本地有线电缆区段，而不是更远的互联网。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:343
msgid "Gateway address"
msgstr "网关地址"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:343
msgid "Leave empty to use the WAN default gateway."
msgstr "留空使用 WAN 默认网关。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:345
msgid "auto"
msgstr "自动"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:348
msgid "In use now"
msgstr "当前使用"

