#, c-format
msgid "tried: %s"
msgstr "已尝试：%s"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:359
msgid "Trace the path during packet loss"
msgstr "丢包时跟踪路径"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:360
msgid "Saves a path trace to the first ping target when packets are lost (at most every 15 minutes), shown on the report and summarized in the complaint summary. With the <code>mtr</code> package installed (<code>apk add mtr-json</code>, or <code>mtr-nojson</code>), MTR measures loss and latency at every hop over several rounds and shows where the loss starts; otherwise a plain traceroute is saved."
msgstr "丢包时保存到第一个 ping 目标的路径跟踪（最多每 15 分钟一次），显示在报告中，并在投诉摘要中汇总。安装 <code>mtr</code> 软件包后（<code>apk add mtr-json</code> 或 <code>mtr-nojson</code>），MTR 会通过多轮测量每一跳的丢包和延迟，并显示丢包从哪里开始；否则保存普通 traceroute。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:364
msgid "MTR rounds"
msgstr "MTR 轮数"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:364
msgid "Probes per hop; each round takes about a second."
msgstr "每一跳的探测次数；每轮约需一秒。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:368
msgid "Path trace tool"
msgstr "路径跟踪工具"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:371
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "未知"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:373
#, c-format
msgid "MTR is installed%s and is used for path traces."
msgstr "已安装 MTR%s，并用于路径跟踪。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:374
msgid "MTR is not installed, so path traces use traceroute (no per-hop loss). Install it with <code>apk add mtr-json</code>, then reload this page."
msgstr "未安装 MTR，因此路径跟踪使用 traceroute（没有逐跳丢包）。请用 <code>apk add mtr-json</code> 安装，然后重新加载此页面。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:378
#, c-format
msgid "Traces the path to the first ping target now (takes about %d seconds) and saves it with the others on the report."
msgstr "立即跟踪到第一个 ping 目标的路径（约需 %d 秒），并与报告中的其他记录一起保存。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:379
msgid "Run a path trace now"
msgstr "立即运行路径跟踪"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:382
#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:403
