#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:408
msgid "Optional. Records outdoor temperature and precipitation from <a href=\"https://open-meteo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open-Meteo</a> (free, no account) so the report can show whether levels or errors follow the weather. Two decimals (about 1 km) is plenty. Find yours by right-clicking a spot in Google Maps."
msgstr "可选。从 <a href=\"https://open-meteo.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open-Meteo</a>（免费且无需账号）记录室外温度和降水量，以便报告显示电平或错误是否随天气变化。两位小数（约 1 公里）已经足够。可在 Google 地图中右键点击位置获取。"

