msgstr "安装地址"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:467
msgid "Speed tests"
msgstr "速度测试"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:468
msgid "Optional daily download and upload test from the router (default server: Cloudflare), with latency measured while idle and under load. Each test uses up to the data limit below in each direction, so mind any data cap. Traffic shaping (SQM) on the router caps the results."
msgstr "可选的每日路由器下载和上传测试（默认服务器：Cloudflare），并分别测量空闲和负载下的延迟。每次测试每个方向最多使用下方数据限制对应的流量，请注意流量套餐上限。路由器上的流量整形（SQM）会限制测试结果。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:470
msgid "Daily speed test"
msgstr "每日速度测试"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:473
