msgstr "运行时间（小时）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:473
msgid "A random minute within the hour is used."
msgstr "会使用该小时内的随机分钟。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:479
