msgstr "每个方向数据上限（MB）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:485
msgid "The test stops at this much data or at the time limit, whichever comes first. Unlimited uses only the time limit: at gigabit speed that is about 1.2 GB per direction for a 10-second test. Pick from the list or type a number."
msgstr "测试会在达到此数据量或时间限制时停止，以先到者为准。无限制则只使用时间限制：千兆速度下，10 秒测试每个方向约使用 1.2 GB。可从列表选择或输入数字。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:486
msgid "Unlimited (time limit only)"
msgstr "无限制（仅时间限制）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:492
msgid "Plan download (Mb/s)"
msgstr "套餐下载速率（Mb/s）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:492
msgid "Optional, in megabits per second (e.g. 1000 for a gigabit plan). Shown on the chart; the complaint summary counts tests below 80% of it."
msgstr "可选，单位为兆比特每秒（例如千兆套餐填 1000）。显示在图表中；投诉摘要会统计低于其 80% 的测试。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:495
msgid "Plan upload (Mb/s)"
msgstr "套餐上传速率（Mb/s）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:495
