msgstr "立即运行速度测试"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:542
#, c-format
msgid "Running: about %d seconds…"
msgstr "正在运行：约 %d 秒…"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:547
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:548
msgid "Copies the data files off the router once a night, so a failed SD card or USB drive doesn't take your history with it. Nothing is deleted at the destination."
msgstr "每晚将数据文件复制到路由器之外，避免 SD 卡或 USB 驱动器故障时丢失历史记录。目标位置不会删除任何内容。"

