msgstr "夜间备份"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:553
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "目标位置"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:554
msgid "A mounted folder (for example a NAS share at /mnt/nas/modem-monitor), or <code>user@host:/path</code> over SSH. For SSH, install <code>rsync</code> (or <code>openssh-client</code>) and add this router's public key (<code>dropbearkey -y -f /root/.ssh/id_dropbear</code>) to the other machine's authorized_keys."
msgstr "一个已挂载的文件夹（例如 NAS 共享 /mnt/nas/modem-monitor），或通过 SSH 使用 <code>user@host:/path</code>。使用 SSH 时，请安装 <code>rsync</code>（或 <code>openssh-client</code>），并将此路由器的公钥（<code>dropbearkey -y -f /root/.ssh/id_dropbear</code>）添加到另一台机器的 authorized_keys。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:558
msgid "SSH key"
msgstr "SSH 密钥"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:558
