msgstr "%s（使用已保存的设置）"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:578
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "集成"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:579
msgid "<b>Prometheus:</b> scrape <code>http://&lt;router&gt;/modem-monitor/metrics.txt</code> (updated every sample). <b>Zabbix:</b> import <code>examples/zabbix/modem_monitor_by_http.yaml</code> from the GitHub repository and link it to the router host; it reads <code>/modem-monitor/latest.json</code>. <b>Home Assistant:</b> fill in MQTT below; sensors appear automatically through MQTT discovery."
msgstr "<b>Prometheus：</b>抓取 <code>http://&lt;router&gt;/modem-monitor/metrics.txt</code>（每次采样更新）。<b>Zabbix：</b>从 GitHub 仓库导入 <code>examples/zabbix/modem_monitor_by_http.yaml</code> 并关联到路由器主机；它读取 <code>/modem-monitor/latest.json</code>。<b>Home Assistant：</b>填写下方 MQTT；传感器会通过 MQTT 发现自动出现。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:581
msgid "Extra metrics file"
msgstr "额外指标文件"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:582
msgid "Optional: also write the Prometheus metrics to this path, for a node-exporter textfile collector."
msgstr "可选：同时将 Prometheus 指标写入此路径，供 node-exporter 文本文件收集器使用。"

