msgstr "主机名或 IP。需要 <code>mosquitto-client-ssl</code>（或 <code>-nossl</code>）软件包。留空关闭 MQTT。警报也会发布到 <em>topic</em>/alert。"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:589
msgid "MQTT port"
msgstr "MQTT 端口"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:592
