#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:618
msgid "Resource profile"
msgstr "资源档位"

#: root/www/luci-static/resources/view/modem-monitor/settings.js:619
#, c-format
msgid "How much memory the monitor uses to save time. <strong>Full</strong> keeps this month's and last month's data in memory, so a report rebuild only reads what is new: several times faster, using a few tens of MB more RAM. <strong>Lite</strong> keeps nothing between rebuilds and builds the report in a short-lived helper, so the always-running service stays small; rebuilds take longer. Every feature works the same and the reports are identical either way. Auto picks Full with at least %d MB of RAM and 2 CPU cores."
msgstr "监控服务用多少内存换取速度。<strong>完整</strong>将本月和上月的数据保留在内存中，因此重建报告只需读取新增内容：速度快数倍，但多占用几十 MB 内存。<strong>轻量</strong>在两次重建之间不保留数据，并由短生命周期辅助进程生成报告，因此常驻服务保持小巧；重建会更慢。两种方式的功能和报告完全相同。自动模式会在内存至少 %d MB 且有 2 个 CPU 核心时选择“完整”。"

